%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c43f8164b2e7043ecad9410bcd382c2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: RecordedVoiceLibrary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GroupProject.Guide.RecordedVoiceLibrary
  entries:
  - id: VOICE_001
    text: Inspect this Class A training plate. Grip the inspection lamp, then hold the trigger and aim at the plate.
    originalName: Cleaning_00
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c12ed9b2dd4e9406e99bdac21f035715, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_002
    text: Inspect the plate with the lamp before choosing a wipe.
    originalName: Cleaning_01
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52a3dbe52e1c847378bbead42e32ea55, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_003
    text: KIMTECH W4 is not suitable for Class A. Choose Anticon Gold polyester.
    originalName: Cleaning_02
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ee0aa50971ec448f0b0f107a0b897fe3, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_004
    text: Anticon Gold is intended for Class A; the client does not recommend it for Class B. Choose KIMTECH W4 here.
    originalName: Cleaning_03
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 855c7e7d083494294b756a41de9f277f, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_005
    text: Use four parallel, slightly overlapping passes. Pull from left to right and lift at each end. Use a fresh face for each pass.
    originalName: Cleaning_04
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c146e469dbb384ed6911241162a691f7, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_006
    text: Lift the wipe off the plate before changing its face.
    originalName: Cleaning_05
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 36f47085eca0d4979bf90cdf25af735e, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_007
    text: Refolded to a fresh face. Make the third pass.
    originalName: Cleaning_06
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b8d01bc3efebf403389fbb5ec801e338, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_008
    text: Flipped to a fresh face. Make the next pass.
    originalName: Cleaning_07
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aaf3be67b41e641899dac2471e4f9a1c, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_009
    text: Four passes completed. Visible particles are reduced; this does not certify cleanliness. Fingerprints and other molecular contamination may remain invisible. Select CONTINUE.
    originalName: Cleaning_08
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a61826465fdac4efda1e828f411943de, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_010
    text: Pass complete. Lifted correctly. Press the trigger to refold to a fresh face.
    originalName: Cleaning_09
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4065a44455791445980e95ac2308ac5d, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_011
    text: Pass complete. Lifted correctly. Press the trigger to flip to a fresh face.
    originalName: Cleaning_10
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 367b7a99669e649fa9cc571058ea0177, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_012
    text: That face has already been used. Lift, then press the trigger for a fresh face.
    originalName: Cleaning_11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 084c06291b4264bae910ce7b4a7207c9, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_013
    text: Lift and start at the left edge of the next parallel pass.
    originalName: Cleaning_12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7201645a68ea64a52ada7a989bb21d9f, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_014
    text: Avoid scrubbing back and forth or crossing the passes. Lift and retry this pass from the left.
    originalName: Cleaning_13
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 30c1586c712ca4b27a3ff167c05d9d4c, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_015
    text: Now try a Class B plate independently. Inspect, choose a suitable wipe, then repeat the four-pass technique.
    originalName: Cleaning_14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf38bceaf938947e1a34d281df7d9c82, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_016
    text: Rehearsal complete. You practised inspection, wipe selection, fresh faces and parallel passes. Follow the approved local procedure for real cleaning; ask trained staff about solvents, ultrasonic baths and baking.
    originalName: Cleaning_15
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 10abddc0873234d3b92b6e2a3cea8051, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_017
    text: Particles are visible in this demonstration. Choose the wipe suitable for Class A. Grip a wipe to pick it up.
    originalName: Cleaning_16
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 288679666d1424edabf8b35ba45858b9, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_018
    text: Particles are visible in this demonstration. Choose the wipe suitable for Class B. Grip a wipe to pick it up.
    originalName: Cleaning_17
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0c7051e11857e43a4920bba133c432f4, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_019
    text: Welcome. Take a moment to look around and get comfortable. Let us explore moving forward, backward, and turning.
    originalName: Welcome_Short
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fa0421c94f7354470a931b6e3a6187d8, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_020
    text: To push the button, aim at the down arrow and click with the controller trigger.
    originalName: ElevatorHint_Prototype
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 76c617066bf734f1f88ff5f4d833d64e, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_021
    text: Welcome aboard. Select B one on the cabin panel to go down.
    originalName: Boarding
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 73ca73b1f56ad4de8b4b18dd0f74dc17, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_022
    text: Doors closing. Going down to level B one. Please stay inside the cabin.
    originalName: Descending
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 70d75a0e062ca4f048e6fe6b248e48be, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_023
    text: Level B one. You have arrived. The doors are opening. You may leave the elevator.
    originalName: Arrival
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a3dfa70f9d4ea4687b71a394e6818a4e, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_024
    text: Push the left stick forward to walk ahead.
    originalName: Move_Forward
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 44d33dda3241440a5bcda23362e60ae6, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_025
    text: Pull the left stick back to move backward.
    originalName: Move_Backward
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ce95d6feea8a249858aa12ecc6cb8eb6, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_026
    text: Move it left or right to step sideways.
    originalName: Move_Sideways
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 069135375bbcf40c593c63eb2d26559a, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_027
    text: Flick left or right to turn in small steps.
    originalName: Move_Turn
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a88c6543838d14ce4a24bd0280270ef3, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_028
    text: Walk forward. Turn left at the corner to find the elevator.
    originalName: Move_Explore
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 346ea68d7ad9a40208e48f5ed16beb33, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_029
    text: Flick the right joystick left or right to turn in small steps. Use the left joystick to walk forward.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 921746d0adafb4a5890f655ac834ada9, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_030
    text: Use the left joystick to move forward or backward. Move it left or right to step sideways.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d09e13a5c3db346bb9d2ca14a3e52b2a, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_031
    text: Enter the cabin through the open door.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f9b6f9202c77d412889f5bc7ed239491, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_032
    text: Go close to the elevator. Aim at the down arrow and press the controller trigger to open the door.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8c0273756ddbb457ab3e5a371aade613, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_033
    text: You have reached the left corridor. Follow the floor arrows toward the elevator.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 491593a3910804fdea63a190c83c3441, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_034
    text: Follow the floor arrows forward to the corner. Then turn left to find the elevator.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b39b3e84db6454a4db9adb239c45c212, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_035
    text: Let's do it together. Push the left joystick forward to follow the floor line. At the corner, flick the right joystick left. Then follow the line to the elevator button, aim at the down arrow, and press the trigger.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bc12a1d8cd80485f9e2246908f56a82, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_036
    text: I am not sure what you mean. Are you asking where an object is, how to use it, or what to do next?
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3d2e1dc7f71944195bd68f375c82dbde, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_037
    text: I'm ready to help, thanks for asking! How are you finding the training?
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48c8e354606c3427692f966496403b76, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_038
    text: Hello! I'm your cleanroom guide. You can ask me where things are or how to use them.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 338547a485ace445ca890b3fed994824, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_039
    text: Look down at the far left of the workbench, while facing the instructions. The purple tool beneath INSPECTION is the lamp. Aim at it and use the grip to pick it up.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4cdb7f2f20945478292c3d6c20f48435, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_040
    text: The Anticon Gold wipe is to the left of the central tray, beside the lamp, beneath the gold ANTICON GOLD label.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2976985ffcd9b43e98105208e5e22193, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_041
    text: The KIMTECH W4 wipe is to the right of the central tray, beneath the teal KIMTECH W4 label.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 47ac3acdb124b48f897593e23156bfb9, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_042
    text: Let's inspect it together. Look down at the purple lamp on the far left of the bench. Aim at it and press grip to pick it up. Hold the trigger and point the lamp at the plate in the centre tray for just over a second.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39f4af7564a2e40dcbf2ec75fdf1d286, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_043
    text: Lift the wipe clear of the plate, then press the trigger to expose a fresh face. Lower it at the left end of the next pass.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 269d76a11de014e67aedd11553f87883, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_044
    text: Place the wipe at the left edge of the plate. Pull it steadily to the right, then lift it clear. Avoid scrubbing back and forth. After each pass, press the trigger while lifted for a fresh face.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 31cbe6092c98349b1a7647176085bdfb, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_045
    text: The four passes are finished. Find CONTINUE at the far right of the bench, aim at it, and press the trigger.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 89ed2c0e9cba74938b857a5ca790723a, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_046
    text: You have finished both practice trials. You can ask about the wipe choices or return along the corridor to the elevator landing.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 90d7002c3c3644691a2a167a0c7766d5, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_047
    text: The training plate is in the dark rectangular tray in the centre of the workbench, below the instructions.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: caf93cd618baf421c9fc6505378af5b5, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_048
    text: The CONTINUE button is on the far right of the workbench. Aim at it and press the trigger.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a88b61292be8d4362bbc83c8ac51418b, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_049
    text: Do you mean the plate, a wipe, or the CONTINUE button?
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2fc82c60848194fe790b83880bbb97d1, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_050
    text: 'Which item are you looking for: the inspection lamp, the plate, or a wipe?'
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9690db541493d4091823b89dde5c5456, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_051
    text: This exercise does not cover chemical, ultrasonic or oven operation. Ask trained staff for the approved local procedure.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 19740a85cb9c344b7bd508388c98936c, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_052
    text: Fingerprints and skin oils are molecular contamination. They may remain invisible after wiping. This exercise does not certify that a part is clean.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dfc4967fe48394de29b89dc1145e373f, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_053
    text: Grip the inspection lamp, hold the trigger, and aim at the training plate for just over one second. The highlighted particles are demonstration visuals, not a cleanliness measurement.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93da11231df3847f689d44440a389b09, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_054
    text: Lift the wipe, then press the trigger to expose a fresh face. After the first pass flip, after the second refold, and after the third flip again.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5231265f15b69420e9d52fff03ea6d5d, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_055
    text: Make four parallel, slightly overlapping passes from left to right. Lift at the end of each pass, then use a fresh face. Do not scrub back and forth.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 77da820448bae45ec8a4fd433d17b09e, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_056
    text: For Class A, use Anticon Gold polyester. KIMTECH W4 polypropylene is for Class B and below, not Class A. Anticon Gold is not recommended for Class B.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7aa1bae49cc394a94a2c998542340dc7, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_057
    text: This face is ready. Make the next pass.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d223894ffd7da472c9e96a94bd6b75b1, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_058
    text: Now lift the wipe to finish this pass.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f45e4acd6d41487bb8a6aaea5912168, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_059
    text: "B1: Arrived. Leave the cabin through the open door."
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aecd7db46b2d94bfb9fbc31b62a80f70, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_060
    text: Going down to B1. Please stay inside the cabin.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f1a7cb36267d846bca3ba1314820bce3, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_061
    text: Journey unavailable. Step outside and try the B1 button again.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e5e870b8e1d1e4104af2a4677fb1118c, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_062
    text: Enter the cabin, aim at B1 and press the controller trigger to go down.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 64585dbd9267748f686119a27f71c863, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_063
    text: You are already holding the inspection lamp.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b7cf0026aa834f8d9d105b90f1930c3, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_064
    text: The inspection lamp has moved away from its labelled place. Look around the bench and on the floor nearby.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe483ba663dd14973a1f8faefc552c43, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_065
    text: You are already holding the Anticon Gold wipe.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 780ccdc1394c945979f5b60d63ebc82e, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_066
    text: The Anticon Gold wipe has moved away from its labelled place. Look around the bench and on the floor nearby.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd5d46ad426e34ccb8a9499d51d9200d, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_067
    text: You are already holding the KIMTECH W4 wipe.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 686bc20d41cf9442aaad51652c6ace34, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_068
    text: The KIMTECH W4 wipe has moved away from its labelled place. Look around the bench and on the floor nearby.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 31b226d1c2d374768991eddf06871896, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_069
    text: So far, I have not yet detected forward movement. Try a small turn. Follow the arrows toward the elevator.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0758917f9d1aa433b9485764384e735f, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_070
    text: So far, I have not yet detected forward movement. Try a small turn. You have also called the elevator.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 391806e9c45334daaab5718372b19199, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_071
    text: So far, I have not yet detected forward movement, and turned. Follow the arrows toward the elevator.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9151608e8b9b948ed95cbd6063124ea1, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_072
    text: So far, I have not yet detected forward movement, and turned. You have also called the elevator.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 230ea875062fc4239b71e7c7dfd25636, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_073
    text: So far, I have not yet detected forward movement, moved backward. Try a small turn. Follow the arrows toward the elevator.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49d157faf74d846a8ade438b72896db6, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_074
    text: So far, I have not yet detected forward movement, moved backward. Try a small turn. You have also called the elevator.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 73d341498d9124e5aaf56ecc8225055d, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_075
    text: So far, I have not yet detected forward movement, moved backward, and turned. Follow the arrows toward the elevator.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f02e51b3502f24296925b08b7d7712bc, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_076
    text: So far, I have not yet detected forward movement, moved backward, and turned. You have also called the elevator.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f43dc680d5acd457999281ba35bc5a76, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_085
    text: The Anticon Gold wipe is to the left of the central tray, beside the lamp, beneath the gold ANTICON GOLD label. Aim at that wipe and use grip to pick it up.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f788ac254f343421092dda2b7e3293d1, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_086
    text: The KIMTECH W4 wipe is to the right of the central tray, beneath the teal KIMTECH W4 label. Aim at that wipe and use grip to pick it up.
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6585fee53b9e2485a9e3a299b59af08e, type: 3}
  - id: VOICE_087
    text: You're welcome!
    originalName: 
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1b37abacc21594939937acbe83a9c05f, type: 3}
